<title>USA: Concord CS, Ind., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Concord CS, Ind., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc. said it won $4.700 million of Concord Community Schools, Ind., general obligation bonds 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.592 percent.</p>
